{"5457850":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Lullaby for a Titan","steam_appid":5457850,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Don't wake the giant.<\/h2>An ancient titan of moss and stone sleeps beneath a little village. Its dreams glow through the cracks of its skin, and the villagers have learned to harvest them. Every building brings in Dream Essence, and every building makes noise. Light sleep pays more, vivid dreams pay even more, but if the titan stirs too often it wakes, and the night is over.<br><br><strong>Grow the village.<\/strong> Dreamcatchers, moth lanterns, wells, bell towers, looms and more: each one earns, each one is louder than the last.<br><br><strong>Keep it asleep.<\/strong> Music boxes, wind chimes, lantern keepers and moss pillows calm the giant. Hum along to its breathing: on the exhale your lullaby soothes it and sweetens its dreams.<br><br><strong>Catch what the night brings.<\/strong> Dream orbs float up from the titan, nightmares slip out in bad dreams, spilled essence scatters when it jolts. Catch them before they fade.<br><br><strong>Research the dream.<\/strong> 50 research topics turn Dream Threads into new tricks for the night.<br><br><strong>Between nights, the Night Store.<\/strong> A tree of 100 permanent perks and four songs to choose from. Each song changes the night's music and how noise and calm work.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Two ways to play<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Rush:<\/strong> the night grows louder by the minute. How long can you keep it asleep?<br><\/li><li><strong>Idle:<\/strong> a calm, endless night with no rising noise. End it when you like.<\/li><\/ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A dark fairytale world in pixel art: a giant that breathes, twitches, turns in its sleep, and wakes in fire.<br><\/li><li>Adaptive music: the lullaby grows with your village and darkens as the titan stirs.<br><\/li><li>100 perks, 50 research topics, 4 songs, 2 game modes.<br><\/li><li>A guided first night with Moth, a small lantern-carrying spirit. Skip it any time.<br><\/li><li>Steam leaderboards for both modes, 20 achievements, Steam Cloud saves.<br><\/li><li>Full controller support (Xbox, PlayStation, Steam Deck) with matching button prompts. Keyboard and mouse fully supported.<br><\/li><li>In English, German, Turkish, French, Italian, Russian and Spanish.<\/li><\/ul>","about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Don't wake the giant.<\/h2>An ancient titan of moss and stone sleeps beneath a little village. Its dreams glow through the cracks of its skin, and the villagers have learned to harvest them. Every building brings in Dream Essence, and every building makes noise. Light sleep pays more, vivid dreams pay even more, but if the titan stirs too often it wakes, and the night is over.<br><br><strong>Grow the village.<\/strong> Dreamcatchers, moth lanterns, wells, bell towers, looms and more: each one earns, each one is louder than the last.<br><br><strong>Keep it asleep.<\/strong> Music boxes, wind chimes, lantern keepers and moss pillows calm the giant. Hum along to its breathing: on the exhale your lullaby soothes it and sweetens its dreams.<br><br><strong>Catch what the night brings.<\/strong> Dream orbs float up from the titan, nightmares slip out in bad dreams, spilled essence scatters when it jolts. Catch them before they fade.<br><br><strong>Research the dream.<\/strong> 50 research topics turn Dream Threads into new tricks for the night.<br><br><strong>Between nights, the Night Store.<\/strong> A tree of 100 permanent perks and four songs to choose from. Each song changes the night's music and how noise and calm work.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Two ways to play<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Rush:<\/strong> the night grows louder by the minute. How long can you keep it asleep?<br><\/li><li><strong>Idle:<\/strong> a calm, endless night with no rising noise. End it when you like.<\/li><\/ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A dark fairytale world in pixel art: a giant that breathes, twitches, turns in its sleep, and wakes in fire.<br><\/li><li>Adaptive music: the lullaby grows with your village and darkens as the titan stirs.<br><\/li><li>100 perks, 50 research topics, 4 songs, 2 game modes.<br><\/li><li>A guided first night with Moth, a small lantern-carrying spirit. Skip it any time.<br><\/li><li>Steam leaderboards for both modes, 20 achievements, Steam Cloud saves.<br><\/li><li>Full controller support (Xbox, PlayStation, Steam Deck) with matching button prompts. Keyboard and mouse fully supported.<br><\/li><li>In English, German, Turkish, French, Italian, Russian and Spanish.<\/li><\/ul>","short_description":"A titan sleeps beneath your village, and its dreams are your harvest. Build, hum the giant's lullaby on its breath, catch dreams and keep its sleep deep. Every building makes noise; every dream tempts you closer to the edge. Don't wake the giant.","supported_languages":"English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Russian, Turkish","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5457850\/e305bb8e32fc373b00432e8b965d29734a0fa087\/header.jpg?t=1793721651","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5457850\/56f208057792d2c5fa0a14384a019cd4ddc3af6f\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793721651","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5457850\/56f208057792d2c5fa0a14384a019cd4ddc3af6f\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793721651","website":"https:\/\/games.vatec-it.com\/","pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Dual core, 2 GHz<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 4096 MB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphic